{"metadata":{"title":"City of Lights","author":"AI","language":"English","difficulty":"A2"},"content":[["Detective Miller","stood","on the rain-soaked street","of London.","Neon lights","reflected","in the puddles","below.","He received","an anonymous tip","about a missing","diamond necklace.","The museum curator","reported","the theft","late last night.","Miller adjusted","his trench coat","and stepped forward","into the shadows."],["The trail led","toward an old","abandoned clock tower","near the river.","As he approached,","he heard","a faint metallic sound","echoing","through the night.","He drew","his flashlight","and pushed open","the heavy wooden door.","Dust particles","danced","in the beam","of light.","Someone was","definitely inside."],["Quietly,","Miller climbed","the spiral stairs.","At the top,","a figure in black","was trying","to pick the lock","of a hidden wall safe.","Stop right there!","Miller shouted,","pointing","his service weapon.","The thief gasped,","dropped the tools,","and raised","both hands.","The priceless necklace","glittered","on the wooden floor","between them.","Another successful case","was closed."]]}